            "review_title": "Review at Pho Hanh",
            "review_text": "kcchin\nHonolulu, HI1072 contributions\n0\nExcellent pho off the beaten path local place\nMar 2019 • Solo\nIf you blink, you will miss the entrance to this excellent pho place. Opens at 6PM....so the small tables and stools are set up on the sidewalk in front the front and across the street. Or you can go down this narrow alleyway/corridor to some interior tables. Their specialty is 'pho ga'.....chicken pho in soup or the dry variety. I was lucky to find this little hidden gem and you should seek it out also if you wish to experience real authentic pho.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 31, 2019",
